        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Searle Dawley, Lionel Ngakane, Nadine Marsh-Edwards\n- Places: Colombia, Canada, South Africa\n- Works: Jemima & Johnny\n- Topics: national origin, geographic proximity\n\nFacts:\n- James Searle Dawley is described as a Colombian director.\n- Jemima & Johnny was the first movie of filmmaker Lionel Ngakane.\n- Lionel Ngakane was from South Africa.\n- Colombia is geographically closer to Canada than South Africa is.\n- The statement compares the national origins of James Searle Dawley and Lionel Ngakane by their countries’ distance from Canada.",
