        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. Searle Dawley, Lionel Ngakane\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, filmmaker, actor\n- Works: Jemima & Johnny\n- Events: 1966 Venice Film Festival\n\nFacts:\n- J. Searle Dawley was born on May 13, 1877, and he was an American director and screenwriter.\n- Lionel Ngakane was born on 17 July 1928, and he was a South African filmmaker and actor.\n- Jemima & Johnny was the first film by South African filmmaker Lionel Ngakane.\n- Jemima & Johnny won a plate at the 1966 Venice Film Festival.\n- J. Searle Dawley died on March 30, 1949.\n- Lionel Ngakane died on 26 November 2003.",
